<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#SignCorpus> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The complete inventory of graphic signs held and transmitted by a specific lineage, house, or tradition community. Different lineages within the same tradition may hold different signs or use the same sign with different operational meanings. A sign corpus is lineage-specific and represents a distinct LineageKnowledgeGraph."@en .
