<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#invokedEntity> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The spiritual entity primarily associated with or invoked by this sign. Range: iroko:SpiritualEntity. Community-restricted."@en .
